#### Firmware Initialization Configuration Binary ####

This binaries are used to configure Firmware during its initialization process.
This file maps binaries with features configured during Firmware initialization.


Filename				| Configured Features
----------------------- | -----------------------------------------------------
88W8987A0_FwConf_0.bin	| OOB IR enabled, LE 2M Disabled


Feature Note:
-------------
Make sure feature related flags are configured appropriately. Refer main readme for more info.
    
    OOB IR enabled : Make sure independent_reset_mode is set to 0 and send_oob_ir_trigger is configured based on platform.
